{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"jigsaw_smol.png","id":"863683480684462100","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863683480684462100-jigsaw_smol.png","message_id":"863683480637276180","sha256":"da416a8fbc9a5db2fd04d38c6b3865c588ae93f2340cff80be9bad30e63afe4a","size":2211,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863683480684462100/jigsaw_smol.png?ex=6ac0aeec&is=6abf5d6c&hm=5d44d47e8d1b6e8c1b438087d4985e4fef5f62dfc40f64a9c5e8074bb735b404&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Your airship has been acting up lately, how sad. Time to call in a mechanic. A strange, short, green humanoid boards your ship and gets to work. You watch them out of the corner of your eye and try to get a read on them. They have some goblin features, green skin and large ears, but other features don’t seem to belong to any race at all. A strange tail that seems to be prehensile, antenna-like protrusions,  a grin with an unsettling amount of teeth, and you swear you see the small white dots below their glasses… blink? Unsettling as it is, they get the job done and leave snickering to themselves upon payment. Your airship seems to work fine now, but occasionally and without warning a high pitched whistle can be heard from the engine in some sort of melody you are unfamiliar with.\n\nhttps://www.dndbeyond.com/profile/badwolf2531/characters/52453023","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:29:48.247000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863683480637276180","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
