{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/jpeg","filename":"PSX_20210711_071834.jpg","id":"863741087364677633","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863741087364677633-PSX_20210711_071834.jpg","message_id":"863741087519342602","sha256":"387c42057426090b96b2fc56d6cc559a4428d386ac1011011e38492bb815d580","size":11085,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863741087364677633/PSX_20210711_071834.jpg?ex=6ac0e492&is=6abf9312&hm=41f100b235dd86f183c6acc3ab712fd0266957630fea4160f9ddd5b8ed1b204f&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Reivax","id":"335629890126610432","is_bot":0,"username":"reivax420"},"author_id":"335629890126610432","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Xae. A verdan bard that's seen some tough times. Never staying in one place too long. Playing at inns and bars to try to earn a night's stay and a few drinks,  cutting purses when the earnings fall short. Shady past and probably a shady future.","created_at":"2021-07-11T11:18:42.798000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863741087519342602","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
