{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Your nearest radio buzzes to life with all channels turned over in sync. That golden voice of the most trusted journalist and influencer in the city springs into life with enthusiasm and pure chords spanning the transatlantic. \n\n\"Hello Empire City! Home of the brave and the bold! Finn Midask here. Today I'll be your radio host and personality of your tried and true Empire City Post Radio!\n\nWant to know about what's going on? Need to catch up with the craziness at ferrytown or learn to avoid getting in trouble with the Pinkertons? I'm your guy!\n\nTheydies and Gentlethems he's, she's, and bees of all ages, I'll be with you every step of the way.\n\nHave a story you want published, investigated, shared, or campaigned with? Come on by The Golden Voice today with a smile and wave in hand and I'll pick ya out!\n\nYour ever gracious host signing off, until next time folks!\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T17:54:59.765000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T16:47:04.488000Z","id":"863840815347269663","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
