{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"unknown.png","id":"866174746440630272","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/866174746440630272-unknown.png","message_id":"866174746907246602","sha256":"cf356d5e396f2d6dfd3d363b57994eca3650b5d691efb235f8e51e47ae4f9784","size":1022424,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/866174746440630272/unknown.png?ex=6ac08498&is=6abf3318&hm=3309938a1177bcdac32c5f932e661db2c101b0c6d6cabec7cf84e760192817ee&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Eliza is a 5' 8” Eladrin Elf that has an olive green skin and quite cheery personality. Loving her games and tricks, but there are days and events that have caused her to change with her emotions from her usual cheeriness. She has been living in Ferrytown since she was born and she has grown to like her little town, but she always wanted to be daring and get what she wants. Most of the time for helping the other people she cares for, but it has led her to being known all around town through general meetings and through agreements in the back alley. At this point she knows her way around town and how to get out of trouble, but if nothing else works, she usually is delighted for a fight! She could also use a challenger…\n    She has never liked the red coats for how they treated others and always saw how she could slow them down or even stop them. She normally puts herself up before others, but that usually splits in the times of others in need. She just lives her life bumping from place to place looking for jobs and maybe being a Robinhood when she sees opportunity. Having been in and out of Faytown multiple times and even going away from her traditional ways and liking the metal work and tools. She hopes to one day work towards getting some of these things.","created_at":"2021-07-18T04:29:12.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866174746907246602","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"Eliza_40x40.png","id":"866174780113813504","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/866174780113813504-Eliza_40x40.png","message_id":"866174780222210058","sha256":"05f90be8f271a1ae3654902b6ad52ed7980a1de0bd500b2f8845b25dadf66106","size":4283,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/866174780113813504/Eliza_40x40.png?ex=6ac084a0&is=6abf3320&hm=1804e55cbf3d53b0c955f6b5b56c4d0534e6f78d2e3af695cfb2a95595d41531&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-18T04:29:20.354000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866174780222210058","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"582810_Y9QmA4Uu.png","id":"868270761910099979","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/868270761910099979-582810_Y9QmA4Uu.png","message_id":"868270762170142720","sha256":"8c1add85bcba84327468bea42a296d1cfba4c8aff06178280780803430105add","size":217772,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/868270761910099979/582810_Y9QmA4Uu.png?ex=6ac0e469&is=6abf92e9&hm=6dfa7a9fcbc810a1ca5d6c0ec35dad33bc58593970f4e6732f3e8d5c80855f65&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Vivica Catla, Sea Elf Rogue. \nHer family immigrated here when she was just a child, and they always dreamed of freedom from european rule, and an easy life. She’s supported the revolutionaries since their beginning and moved to Empire city to work as an informant and spy. However, Empire city could not hold her for long, she left for Europe to gather resources and supporters, sending weapons and information. Now she is back. It’s been a few years but she is hoping to see some old friends (assuming they haven’t died yet) and join the thick of the fight once more.","created_at":"2021-07-23T23:18:01.392000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868270762170142720","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
